{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../InputChecklist/", "title": "InputChecklist"}, "next": {"link": "../ChecklistTasksAdded/", "title": "ChecklistTasksAdded"}, "title": "ChecklistTasksDone", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"checklisttasksdone\">\n<h1>ChecklistTasksDone<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#checklisttasksdone\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.ChecklistTasksDone\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ChecklistTasksDone</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.ChecklistTasksDone\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Describes a service message about checklist tasks marked as done or not done.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>checklist_message_id</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 Identifier of the message with the checklist.\nCan be None if the message was deleted.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>marked_as_done_task_ids</strong> (List of <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 Identifiers of tasks that were marked as done.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>marked_as_not_done_task_ids</strong> (List of <code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></code>) \u2013 Identifiers of tasks that were marked as not done.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-mo